@name     macro_clear_all
@alias    /m!
@group    sys
@c_name   skode_clause_macro_clear_all
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  clear all defined user macros
@doc
Deletes all registered user macros from memory.
Usage: /m!
@code
    return skode_exec_slashm_bang(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
